  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A gray cloak with nothing remarkable about it, which is the remarkable thing. People asked to describe its wearer afterward can never agree on a height, a face or a voice.</p><p><strong>Unseen.</strong> As a Bonus Action, you pull up the hood and have the Invisible condition until you lower it (no action required). The cloak holds one hour of this each day, spent in minutes, and attacking or casting a spell does not end it. The hour returns at dawn.</p><p><strong>The Hour Nobody Kept.</strong> Whatever the wearer does while unseen is forgotten by everyone who was near, within the day: they recall that time passed and nothing else. The wearer remembers. So does the cloak, and it can be asked.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
